                f"Rydberg Matter: d_Ryd = 2.9�n�_B�a0 = {d_Ryd*1e12:.2f} pm  (n_B={n_B})",
                "Meson chain: DN(0) ? K� ? p� ? �� ? e�",
                f"  938 ? 493 ? 139 ? 105 ? 0.511 MeV  (total {meson_total_MeV:.1f} MeV)",
                "SCm phonon match: F(?_laser, G) = exp(-(?-1.25THz)�/(2G�))",
                f"  F_match = {Phi_match:.4f}  (phonon resonance alignment)",
                f"KER_SCm = 2h?_eff = {KER_SCm_eV:.2f} eV  (SCm phonon energy)",
                f"?_cluster/?_SCm = {density_ratio:.4e}  (density bridge factor)",
                "F_U_Bi_i (Gaussian bound) prevents cluster collapse",
                f"Spontaneous formation at t_n={t_n:.1f} s (no laser) = {spontaneous}",
